      "title": "epan: Use unsigned offsets for tvb_strn[case]eql, tvb_memeql",
      "message": "epan: Use unsigned offsets for tvb_strn[case]eql, tvb_memeql\n\nAlso treat the size as unsigned. (No users in the repo use -1 to\nmean the entire length.) Note that these functions accept a size_t\nfor the length, but values that large probably don't work.\n\nPing #20103\n",
